<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-General Mills estimate cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-General Mills estimate cut.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities analyst John O'Neil said Friday he reduced his earnings estimate for General Mills Inc to $3.25 a share from $3.35 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- He initiated an estimate for the cereal and food producer of $3.55 for fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>-- O'Neil said he lowered his fiscal 1998 earnings estimate due to expected slower growth in General Mills' Big G cereal volume.</p>
<p>-- His rating on the stock remains market performer.</p>
<p>-- General Mills shares were up 3/4 at 65-3/4.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
